flowchart TD
  X[Organization-scoped meter history] --> Q[Quality-aware hourly preparation]
  Q --> S[Chronological 70/15/15 split]
  S --> C[Compare baseline candidates; optional Random Forest/XGBoost]
  C --> V[Choose by validation MAE]
  V --> T[Evaluate once on held-out test segment]
  T --> M[Persist model lifecycle, metrics, provenance and artifact]
  M --> F[Generate 24/168-hour forecast]
  F --> P[Persist meter-level predictions]
  X --> A[Historical anomaly analysis]
  A --> B[Prior same-local-hour/weekday median + MAD]
  B --> I[Optional Isolation Forest in combined mode]
  I --> E[Persist evidence, baseline size, quality and context]
